  "text": "### 2. Authority & Responsibilities  \n**Strategic Risk Oversight:**\n- Approve enterprise risk management framework\n- Review and approve Risk Appetite Statement\n- Monitor risk-weighted capital adequacy\n- Assess emerging risks to the bank's strategy  \n**Capital Management:**\n- Monitor capital ratios (Pillar 1 minimum >15%)\n- Approve capital raising/deployment decisions\n- Stress testing and scenario analysis\n- Capital distribution (dividends, buybacks, if applicable)  \n**Credit Risk:**\n- Review credit strategy and risk limits\n- Monitor loan portfolio quality\n- Assess borrower concentration risk\n- Review major lending decisions (mortgages >£500k)  \n**Operational Risk:**\n- Review operational risk incidents\n- Assess control environment\n- Monitor operational risk KRIs\n- Approve risk mitigation strategies  \n**Compliance & Regulatory:**\n- Monitor regulatory compliance\n- Review audit findings and remediation\n- Assess regulatory relationships\n- Approve regulatory responses  \n**Fraud & Financial Crime:**\n- Review fraud incidents and investigations\n- Monitor AML/KYC effectiveness\n- Review SAR (Suspicious Activity Report) filings\n- Assess anti-fraud controls  \n**Cybersecurity & Technology:**\n- Review cybersecurity risks\n- Monitor system availability\n- Assess major technology investments\n- Review incident response procedures",
  "name": "Chunk 4/14",
  "domain": "banking_risk_governance",
  "prev_chunk_id": "9d86cba3fdf1406a89cf7a0d9860aa41_003",
